# Claude Code: the PROJECT rules are tracked (.claude/settings.json and the
# guard they point at), because the guard only protects a tree it is in -- a
# fresh clone with no guard is the case it exists for. The LOCAL file is not:
# it accumulates per-machine approvals with absolute paths and one-off
# commands, and it grows every session.
.claude/settings.local.json
